# Level 4 (planet 4): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots twice and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. Domes 1E, wide machines 1C and 1D, large machines 22, hourglass
# turrets 19, block turrets 1B and the generators 48, 49, 4B and 4C with their mines and drones,
# and their shots, missiles and exhaust.
level 4
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
